HDD vs SSD vs NVMe
==================

Feature        HDD                  SSD                  NVMe SSD
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Speed          Slow                 Fast                 Fastest

Technology     Magnetic disk        Flash memory         Flash + PCIe

Moving Parts   Yes                  No                   No

Best For       Large file storage   Daily applications   Heavy applications

Daily Use      File storage         Chrome / Edge        Adobe Premiere Pro

Cost           Cheap                Medium               Expensive

